{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And he shall make her drink</b> — Three times in the Masorah: והשקה את האשה, והשקה את נחל השטים, ואד יעלה מן הארץ והשקה. והשקה etc. — the priest puts dust into the water and makes her drink it, and this is ואד יעלה מן הארץ והשקה — why? Because she did an act of שטים, that she committed adultery, and this is והשקה את נחל השטים."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:11.743072781Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}